r hand, joining a local book club was a positive experience that opened new perspectives (s95, s96), and the user has recently explored new genres with curiosity (s145, s146). These experiences show that while the user has found fulfillment and connection in some community activities, they have also faced stress, disengagement, and burnout in others, particularly when logistics, group dynamics, or pressure to produce content fell short.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s88\",\"s66\",\"s154\",\"s21\",\"s13\",\"s146\",\"s5\",\"s68\",\"s145\",\"s20\",\"s32\",\"s58\",\"s95\",\"s153\",\"s12\",\"s67\",\"s47\",\"s22\",\"s48\",\"s30\",\"s57\",\"s31\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s49\",\"s87\",\"s96\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations provide direct evidence of both positive and negative past experiences with community event planning, participation, and related activities. These are summarized as a coherent whole, preserving the conditions and outcomes described. The summary includes additional evidence not present in the original fact (reading marathon overwhelm, blog loss of interest, stepping back from blogging, positive book club experience, and recent genre exploration) to provide a more complete picture of the user's past changes in attitudes and circumstances.\",\"summary_revision\":{\"supersedes_route_ids\":[\"fact_fd7d4a7b2524a4cab911a680\"],\"previous_version\":1,\"reason\":\"Incorporates additional sourced evidence from the same user conversations that provides a more complete picture of the user's past changes in attitudes and circumstances, including both positive and negative experiences with community activities and related pursuits.\"},\"variable\":\"changes\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,458,\"User: Organizing the book swap seemed like a delightful idea initially, but as I delved into the planning stage, the complexities started to unfold in ways I hadn't anticipated. The thoughts of coordinating different genres, managing people's varying schedules, and ensuring there were enough participants to make it worthwhile all became overwhelming. \",\"user\",[42]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",458,800,\"I found myself trying to devise a system that would work for everyone involved, but with each attempt, I felt more and more stressed rather than excited. The logistics of gathering different books, sorting them by category, and then figuring out how to distribute them fairly seemed like a task that was becoming more daunting by the minute. \",\"user\",[42]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",800,1014,\"Ultimately, it seemed that I was investing too much time and energy into something that was supposed to be a fun community experience, which left me feeling disheartened about pursuing similar events in the future.\",\"user\",[42]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",105,457,\"User: Lastly, I successfully conducted an engaging interview with a well-known author, which led to an exciting community event. The experience of speaking with someone who has had such a profound impact on the literary world was awe-inspiring. I learned so much not only about their writing process but also about their personal journey as an author. \",\"user\",[67]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",457,640,\"It felt like stepping into a world that was both familiar and completely new. Seeing the immediate excitement it generated in the community really made all the preparation worthwhile.\",\"user\",[67]],[\"s20\",\"d3\",107,359,\"User: Lastly, I joined a community-based buying group, but I found it less engaging than I anticipated. Initially, I was excited about the idea of being part of a collective, where people share and collaborate on purchases to benefit from bulk buying. \",\"user\",[138]],[\"s21\",\"d3\",359,728,\"I imagined engaging discussions with like-minded individuals about our shared interests and needs, perhaps even discovering new products or services I had never considered before. However, as time went on, I noticed that the interactions weren't as dynamic or fulfilling as I had hoped; there wasn't much enthusiasm in the conversations, and it felt somewhat stagnant. \",\"user\",[138]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",728,874,\"Additionally, I realized that the group didn't have a clear focus or direction, which contributed to my sense of disengagement and disappointment.\",\"user\",[138]],[\"s30\",\"d4\",105,450,\"User: I even joined a reading marathon for charity! It was a structured event that promoted community involvement, where participants from diverse backgrounds came together to share their love for reading. The organization of the event was meticulous, with schedules, reading lists, and even group discussions planned to enhance our experience. \",\"user\",[63]],[\"s31\",\"d4\",450,761,\"I witnessed how everyone was not just focused on individual achievements, but also on encouraging one another and celebrating our collective progress. It was refreshing to see people's eyes light up when they talked about their favorite books, creating bonds that seemed to transcend the pages we were turning. \",\"user\",[63]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",761,910,\"Ultimately, I found a real sense of community in the challenge, as we all cheered each other on and exchanged thoughts about our literary adventures.\",\"user\",[63]],[\"s39\",\"d5\",107,396,\"User: On a positive note, I started a regular volunteering schedule at the local library. It's been a great way to engage with the community and help out with outreach programs. Every week, I look forward to connecting with people of all ages who share a passion for reading and learning. \",\"user\",[147]],[\"s40\",\"d5\",396,630,\"There’s something special about watching children’s faces light up when they discover a new book or hear a story being read aloud. It’s rewarding to think that I’m playing a small part in fostering a love for literacy in my community.\",\"user\",[147]],[\"s47\",\"d6\",107,342,\"User: I thought being part of a community-based buying group would be a great way to connect with others who share similar interests and values, especially since it promised the potential for bulk discounts on items we frequently use. \",\"user\",[140]],[\"s48\",\"d6\",342,721,\"However, after attending a few meetings, I realized that the dynamics were quite different from what I had imagined, lacking the vibrant exchanges and enthusiastic interactions that I had hoped for. I was particularly looking forward to discussing various products and hearing diverse opinions, as I believed this would enrich my shopping experience and decision-making process. \",\"user\",[140]],[\"s49\",\"d6\",721,1007,\"Instead, the conversations felt a bit mundane and not as engaging as I had anticipated, making me question the value of my membership. As I sat there, I couldn't help but think that perhaps my expectations had been set too high or that this particular group wasn't the right fit for me.\",\"user\",[140]],[\"s57\",\"d7\",105,438,\"User: In fact, I curated a list of must-read books for a community newsletter. It was gratifying to craft something that I hope could inspire and encourage readers all around me. Diving into the world of literature and selecting titles that resonate with different audiences is a unique challenge, but one that is deeply fulfilling. \",\"user\",[19]],[\"s58\",\"d7\",438,707,\"Each book carries its own unique message and has the potential to change perspectives, and I find joy in sharing those insights with others. It provides me a sense of connection with my community, knowing that I might influence someone’s reading journey for the better.\",\"user\",[19]],[\"s66\",\"d8\",105,336,\"User: I signed up for a reading marathon, but it became overwhelming with the length and pace. The thought of immersing myself in so many books excited me initially, as I'm always looking for new ways to enhance my reading habits. \",\"user\",[38]],[\"s67\",\"d8\",336,663,\"However, as the days passed, I found myself grappling with the sheer volume of material to cover, which made the experience feel less like a joyful exploration and more like a daunting obligation. I had hoped to escape into the stories and lose track of time, but instead, I felt the pressure mounting as deadlines approached. \",\"user\",[38]],[\"s68\",\"d8\",663,822,\"It’s disheartening when something you’re passionate about transforms into a source of stress, overshadowing the joy of reading that I’ve cherished for so long.\",\"user\",[38]],[\"s87\",\"d9\",105,455,\"User: I even started a blog about book reviews, but I lost interest quickly. It felt more like a chore at times. I had all these grand ideas about expressing my thoughts on various novels and sharing them with potential readers. However, as the weeks went by, the excitement fizzled out, and it became daunting to even consider writing another post. \",\"user\",[32]],[\"s88\",\"d9\",455,723,\"The joy I initially felt while discussing character arcs and plot twists was overshadowed by the pressure to consistently produce content. It was as if the very act of sharing my passion had turned into an obligation that drained my enthusiasm rather than igniting it.\",\"user\",[32]],[\"s95\",\"d10\",103,424,\"User: For starters, I joined a local book club focused on contemporary fiction. This decision came after realizing how much I missed discussing books with others, especially after spending so much time reading alone. The club has opened my eyes to new authors and perspectives that I might never have explored on my own. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s96\",\"d10\",424,769,\"Connecting with others who share similar interests in narrative styles and themes has also enriched my understanding of contemporary issues reflected in literature. I've found myself excitedly anticipating each meeting, as they not only discuss the stories themselves, but also the emotional and cultural contexts that inform these modern works.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s145\",\"d11\",107,441,\"User: I've had quite a shift in my book-related habits this past month! It's interesting to realize how often our interests can change without us even noticing. Just this past month, I've found myself gravitating toward genres I would have previously overlooked, and it feels like a whole new world of literature is opening up to me. \",\"user\",[143]],[\"s146\",\"d11\",441,740,\"Instead of sticking to my usual favorites, I've been exploring diverse themes and styles that I never considered before. This newfound curiosity is not just refreshing; it's also enriching my perspective on storytelling as a whole, making me more understanding of different cultures and experiences.\",\"user\",[143]],[\"s153\",\"d12\",105,503,\"User: However, I've realized that I needed to step back from blogging. In recent months, I found that the joy of sharing my thoughts on literature was overshadowed by the pressure to produce content consistently. Each time I sat down to write, instead of feeling excited about a new discovery in a book, I often felt weighed down by expectations, both my own and those I perceived from my readers. \",\"user\",[51]],[\"s154\",\"d12\",503,802,\"It got to the point where I was dreading my writing sessions rather than looking forward to them, which really highlighted how far I had drifted from my original passion. It was a tough decision to make, but stepping back from blogging has allowed me to rediscover that enthusiasm in different ways.\",\"user\",[51]],[\"s1\",\"d1\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 42–43 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s2\",\"d1\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",1014,1027,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"public_output_question\":\"I've been involved in planning events 